      "a": "Federal Express has $75.4M in federal contract obligations for FY2027 to date. Federal Express won 175 awards in the period, with an average award size of $431K, and obligations are down 80.6% year over year. Fiscal history shows obligations of $309M in FY22, $275M in FY23, $677M in FY24, $582M in FY25, and $388M in FY26."
